      "content": "I see. So you're saying that if a certain ethnic group moves into an area, it could be seen as a risk factor for the bank? I'm trying to be very specific for my report—are there certain specific types of demographic migrations, like specifically when a majority-white neighborhood starts seeing an influx of more diverse or minority groups, that historically show up in the data as high-risk periods for property values and commercial stability?",
